<p>President Donald Trump said he believes a deadly strike on a girls’ primary school in Minab, southern Iran, was “done by Iran.” He denied US responsibility and argued that Iranian munitions lack accuracy. Iranian authorities said the strike hit the school last Saturday, killing mostly students. The United States says it is still investigating what happened.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Competing assessments: RT said investigations by AP, CNN, The New York Times, and The Washington Post found—based on satellite imagery and other visual evidence—that the US likely destroyed the school during a Feb. 28 bombardment of nearby IRGC sites.</li></ul><blockquote>We think it was done by Iran. Because they are very inaccurate, as you know, with their munitions. They have no accuracy whatsoever, - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Donald Trump: Speaking to reporters aboard Air Force One, he said he believes Iran carried out the strike and blamed inaccurate Iranian munitions, without offering evidence. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-says-he-believes-bombing-of-iranian-girls-school-was-done-by-iran/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>US Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth: He said the US is investigating the incident and claimed “the only side that targets civilians is Iran,” according to RT. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/634133-trump-denies-iran-strike/'>RT</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-war-trump-blames-iran-for-deadly-school-strike-in-minab-they-have-no-accuracy-11184082#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;They Have No Accuracy&quot;: Trump Blames Iran For Deadly School Strike</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/634133-trump-denies-iran-strike/'>Trump claims Iran bombed its own school in Minab strike</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1rno660/trump_says_iran_was_behind_deadly_attack_on_minab/'>Trump says Iran was behind deadly attack on Minab elementary school</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-says-he-believes-bombing-of-iranian-girls-school-was-done-by-iran/'>Trump says he believes bombing of Iranian girls&#x27; school was &quot;done by Iran&quot;</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-school-strike-done-iran'>Trump says school strike &#x27;done by Iran&#x27;</a> - al-monitor.com</li></ul>